        "shortName": "FCPC V5",
        "description": "The fifth-generation FCPC plate carrier continues Ferro Concepts’ focus on lightweight, adaptable gear. In this version, the plate bags and carrier contour have been redesigned for improved comfort and mobility. White Tusk version. Equipped with two radios for communicating with both the assigned squad and HQ."
